            "question": "What is Sapphire Shadow Studio and who runs it?",
            "answer": "<p>Sapphire Shadow Studio is a small custom craft studio where we make apparel that actually stands out plus some other interests. No mass production, no cutting corners, just quality pieces we'd want to own ourselves.<br/><br/>We're Maddie and Seth, a husband-and-wife team running this whole operation. Maddie designs every piece, Seth handles the tech side, and our cats supervise while demanding lots of pets.<br/><br/>Learn more about our story and why we do what we do on our <a href=\"/pages/about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">About page</a>.<br/></p>",
