          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the quality of your studio items?",
            "answer": "<p>Nobody likes getting cheap garbage online, especially us.<br/><br/>Every piece at Sapphire Shadow Studio passes our simple test: would we want to own it ourselves? If the answer's no, it doesn't make it into the shop. We use quality materials, obsess over the details, and inspect everything before it ships.<br/><br/>Learn more about our principles on our <a href=\"/pages/about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">About page</a>.</p>",
            "custom_anchor": ""
          }
